OL,3,GNEWSAInquiry into death of 86-year-old
OL,4,Aman found beside crashed car
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe death of an 86-year-old man whose
OL,7,Fbody was found beside his crashed car
OL,8,Ftwo days after being reported missing
OL,9,Fwill be examined at a fatal accident
OL,10,Finquiry (FAI).
OL,12,FJohn Winton McNab, from Perth, was
OL,13,Ffound by officers next to his Mercedes
OL,14,Fon the A887 at Invermoriston in the
OL,15,FHighlands on 18 September, 2022.
OL,17,FHe had last been seen on 13 September,
OL,18,Fwith police alerted three days later.
OL,20,FA preliminary hearing for the FAI will
OL,21,Ftake place on 21 December at Falkirk
OL,22,FSheriff Court.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
